// "MatHandwerk": a sticky header with phone / WhatsApp / call-to-action, card sections, a dark four-column footer. Its menu style is a
// template parameter (Unterstrich | Schlicht | Pillen) the header carries as data-menu; phone, WhatsApp, e-mail and the call-to-action
